                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So glad I bought this game on sale!\nThe graphics and comic storybook elements of the game were stunning to take in, and boy oh boy.. the voice acting was incredible!!! Even on Low-Medium graphics, the different colours and texture looked beautiful. Gameplay had similar elements like lock picking, and pickpocketing staff or security, but I really did enjoy the story! I did expect it to be longer.. a shame it wasn't, and a shame that the studio shut down so Season 2 isn't happening. But apart from that, A HUGE RECOMMEND!!",
